\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Workflow of the revenue-stacking framework. The stacking MILP co-optimises the facility schedule and market commitments; the certification loop verifies duration-deliverability of every commitment against the magnitude--duration envelope of the companion paper and returns cuts until the portfolio is certified; the annual simulation repeats the certified daily problem across two years of GB market data. The daily problem is solved both as a full-information co-optimisation (benchmark B4, the upper bound) and gate-sequentially, with within-day products limited to the residual flexibility left by the day-ahead stage (benchmark B5).}}{7}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:workflow}{{1}{7}{Workflow of the revenue-stacking framework. The stacking MILP co-optimises the facility schedule and market commitments; the certification loop verifies duration-deliverability of every commitment against the magnitude--duration envelope of the companion paper and returns cuts until the portfolio is certified; the annual simulation repeats the certified daily problem across two years of GB market data. The daily problem is solved both as a full-information co-optimisation (benchmark B4, the upper bound) and gate-sequentially, with within-day products limited to the residual flexibility left by the day-ahead stage (benchmark B5)}{figure.1}{}}
